--- a/docs/reference.md
+++ b/docs/reference.md
@@ -121,6 +121,11 @@ layers are reported together; a syntax error in the file stops loading.
 | `msg.bad_section` | `bad section name '{name}'` | |
 | `msg.lookup` | `unknown key '{key}' (did you mean '{match}'?)` | Raised as `KeyError` by `Config.get`, `Config[key]` and `Config.source`, and printed by `get` and `explain` on the command line. The suggestion is the closest key or alias and is left off when none is close. |
 | `msg.unreadable` | `cannot read {path}: {reason}` | |
+| `msg.pool_order` | `pool.min_size: must not exceed pool.max_size` | Reported where `pool.min_size` was set. Equal sizes are allowed. |
+| `msg.tls_pair` | `server.tls_cert and server.tls_key must be set together` | Reported where the one that is set came from. |
+
+The two rules across options are checked only when every value is valid on its
+own.
 
